# Ursine Monstrosity's beginning-of-combat ability mills a Forest each combat (one card type in the graveyard), so it is a 4/4 with indestructible that must attack the opponent chosen at random (CR 508.1d): no attack is scripted, and it attacks anyway for 4.

[Bot1 Deck]
Sol Ring
Ursine Monstrosity
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ursine Monstrosity.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ursine Monstrosity.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Ursine Monstrosity.Keywords = Indestructible; Trample
Bot1.Battlefield.Ursine Monstrosity.Tapped = true
